      "language": "zh",
      "title_zh": "京张水准线：一次闭合，在时间里",
      "title_en": "The Leveling Line: one closure, in time",
      "description_zh": "54 秒动态示意图（无声）：水准线从已知点出发，逐站传递高程，绕一周回到原点，剩下的差值就是闭合差。站序、路线长度与 107 个架站由随包几何在 EPSG:4548 下算出；高差起伏为示意，非实测高程，非实景渲染。",
      "description_en": "A 54-second silent animated diagram: the line departs a known point, carries height forward setup by setup, comes back round to the origin, and what does not cancel is the closure error. Station order, route lengths and 107 instrument setups are computed from the shipped geometry in EPSG:4548; the profile is illustrative of accumulation, not surveyed elevation, and is not a rendering of built conditions.",
